# Production secrets for the IG Grabber stack. Copy to /opt/ig/.env on the VPS,
# then `sudo chown 65534:65534 /opt/ig/.env` (the backend container runs as uid
# 65534 and rewrites this file when the Instagram session cookie rolls or is
# renewed in-app). Never commit the filled file.
#
#   scp deploy/.env.example <user>@<vps>:/opt/ig/.env

# Instagram sessionid cookie — optional, and only ever for a THROWAWAY account.
# Without it the app runs anonymously: profiles + profile pictures only.
# Log in to instagram.com with the burner, then:
#   DevTools -> Application -> Cookies -> https://www.instagram.com -> sessionid
IG_SESSIONID=
